{"id":1761,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>5月30日上午，环境与安全工程学院研究生趣味运动会于双创学院楼前广场如期开赛。赛事以团队协作为主线，全体研究生踊跃报名、积极参赛，在轻松欢乐的趣味比拼中挥洒汗水、奋勇拼搏。</p><p>活动现场精彩纷呈，珠行万里、企鹅漫步、两人三足、螃蟹横行、托球快跑、不倒森林等趣味项目轮番上演，参赛队员默契配合、从容应战；拔河赛场气氛热烈高涨，各代表队凝心聚力、奋勇角逐，在奋力拉锯间磨炼协作意识、厚植团队情谊。</p><p>此次趣味运动会圆满收官，既丰富了研究生课余文体生活，又切实增强集体凝聚力与向心力。学院将持续传承昂扬向上、团结奋进的体育精神，引导学子以昂扬姿态彰显新时代青年的蓬勃朝气与青春风采。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FUNV97nmTfMRNioAzLDU4lZnRlYo7n1kolWkoRvYU4U8Um-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2LkyPokyPUm-ZU8UPL4CsM4lZLzV2Lm7Dnm9ioRNanlVFL8rfLR-DLNVFM4GZMzCJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL4M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11336&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9F0181B28CD136775811F216F85890EA/3EA0262A/70856\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FL879ZnzVkoRffUAN-PMmAVL4QkozN1YMzNinRAkU8MfoR90gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4oSy8USyZU8-4UzrVL8Q2U87YLmCPnmvanmlaM7L4M46FnmG4LzG8nmTFMNL8M462gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz74L4CJqdmnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11336&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Fozf97LzvYLRG8UAN-4UllbUz6koRN1bM7lZoRviMRMknl70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaokhVMkhVLR74UlUPM4TfU4CYUzvbnRLDLzVfnz-inRAFoRlYol-soRrFUzrRLz7Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL4M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11336&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/008E4E013AD179AC62A79D3611AE25D8/8529B785/A5C11\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 380px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FM4f9foRUiozW7UAzVfUmWkM4VfLm-14UNUsLRNaL8C8nl70gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkMkysnSh2MRvYU8CDnmCYnRUDMz6VnRA2L7-bUm-aM4fFLRfRLN-iMRVFL4LYMRLZgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz74L4CJqdmnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11336&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FMm79YL8-8LznRMARMfL4A7nz7Zoz71aUmnfnzMVLRLPUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhRMYy4okhfM8L4LzAknRvPMmLsozA7nmWkU4TfUNUDLmWFLRGPo7rRLlVFM77ZMz-Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL4M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11336&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4C738A7C318BD7163798DF2BC9ABD622/0018EC1A/4A852\" 